# Trivy IaC ignore rules
# Format: <rule-id>[:<subcategory>] <comment>

# CDK-generated Lambda IAM role with wildcard permissions is standard pattern
AVD-AWS-0057 CDK-managed Lambda execution role uses scoped wildcard permissions

# CDK custom resource provider uses managed policies
AVD-AWS-0058 CDK custom resource provider requires managed IAM policies

# VPC flow logs disabled for non-production environments
AVD-AWS-0046 VPC flow logs not enabled in sample stack; enable for prod

# SNS topic uses email subscriptions (internal alarm topic)
AVD-AWS-0128 Internal alarm topic uses email subscriptions

# API Gateway without WAF is acceptable for internal service APIs
AVD-AWS-0092 IAM auth is primary mechanism; WAF at account level
